[Web Evidence] URL 1: https://prettier.io/playground/#N4Igxg9gdgLgprEAuEBLAtgBwgJxgAmAGEItoEYBffAMx1PwHIABAQygHMBXAG1ZwD0kHHEYBuADpQpzEmSgUAFMCn58AZzg84YGLiRNWmTAFp6EGIwA0q- Summary: Prettier Prettier

